  first | exact @GlobalTheory.LatConjSplit.splitAt_of_isLatticeConj | exact GlobalTheory.LatConjSplit.splitAt_of_isLatticeConj | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.LatConjSplit.splitAt_of_isLatticeConj <;> assumption)
